<!-- G11a-2 fixture, written by hand for the parity harness of PPP (no source music): tempo marks between the notes of a bar. Bar 1: 120 a minute (sound and metronome). Bar 2, after the second quarter: 80 (a sound only), and bar 2 opens a repeat that ends at bar 3. Bar 3, after the first quarter: an eighth = 160 (a metronome mark only, 80 a minute), after the third quarter: 100 (sound). Bar 4: 60 at the very start. Written order: 1 2 3 | 2 3 4 - the second pass of bar 2 starts at the tempo written before it (120), not the one bar 3 ended on. -->
